    "number": 150,
    "title": "Record completed guide clarity work",
    "body": "Hub #148 is closed after source PR #149 merged and its guide-only CI evidence was verified. Retain it as a completed reference, remove it from open coverage, and move the development guide's next step to the separately scoped Prism design. The refreshed snapshot now has 91 open issues across 12 guides.\n\nRefs #148. This is the status reconciliation required before the user-requested public publication; it adds no product milestone, behavior or architecture change. Public publication follows this verified source revision.\n\nGeneration, nine maintenance tests and the complete six-width browser/PDF checks passed. The committed output rebuilds without drift. HTML SHA-256: `185bf88047b9a5f9c7ebaaf8c7b35465cade8c4840e81f91bda27667d810e280`. Screenshots, PDF and the verification receipt are retained outside Git.\n\nFixed review comparison: base/merge-base `56e5667342cd446a229a4234dadf13fe3d07b0a2` to head `4a3f01dda3d80b613217d9668e0a79f1d663e767`; clean worktree. Independent Standards and Specification review will inspect these commits. Guide UI is exempt from human approval.\n\nGuide-only CI exception: the complete file list below stays within docs/work-guide/. Both unchanged workflows exclude that path for PR and main push. Current-head check/run/event readback and the authoritative merge state are required before guarded merge. Branch protection previously returned the repository-plan 403; no bypass is authorized.\n\nChanged paths:\n\n- `docs/work-guide/outputs/agent-device-work-guides.html`\n- `docs/work-guide/updates.md`\n- `docs/work-guide/work/backlogs/agent-device-hub-digest.txt`\n- `docs/work-guide/work/backlogs/agent-device-hub-issues.json`\n- `docs/work-guide/work/backlogs/agent-device-hub-prs.json`\n- `docs/work-guide/work/backlogs/guide-coverage.json`\n- `docs/work-guide/work/backlogs/hub-native-deps.json`\n- `docs/work-guide/work/backlogs/snapshot.json`\n- `docs/work-guide/work/build_guide.py`\n- `docs/work-guide/work/guide_paths.py`\n- `docs/work-guide/work/timeline.py`\n",
